<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40175" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμέμφομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cast blame upon</i>, c.dat. pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ τι κασιγνήτοις ἐπιμέμφεαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.97
				</span></i>
			, etc.: c.gen. rei, <i>find fault for</i> or <i>because
			of</i> a thing, <i>complain of</i> it, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχωλῆς ἐπιμέμφεται</span>
			<i>complains of</i> a vow [neglected], <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.65
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.225
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕνεκ᾽ ἀρητῆρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.94
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινί τινος</span>
			<i>blame</i> one <i>for</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				27.2
			</span></i>; rarely 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινά τινος, ὧν ἐπιμεμφομένα σε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					122
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): c. acc., <i>blame</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Del.</u>
					163
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γηραλέην χεῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.83
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>); <i>find fault, complain</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲν ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.116
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>. b.c. inf., <i>to be unwilling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				1.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c. acc. rei,
				<i>impute as matter of blame</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ Κροῖσος ἐπιμεμφόμενος τῷ Κύρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.75
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.161
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
